    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists or friends wont change the reality tho. they'll just tell me to \"cope\" or \"be patient\" while i keep playing this part. it’s like being buried alive under everyone else's dreams and traditions. there's no version of my life where i actually get to exist as myself. the walls are just closing in more every day and i don't see any way out that doesn't involve losing everything i am.",
